          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3><strong>Privacy Policy for Imperial Knots</strong></h3><h4><strong>SECTION 1 - WHAT DO WE DO WITH YOUR INFORMATION?</strong></h4><p>When you purchase from our store, we collect personal information such as your name, address, and email address to process your order.<br/>When you browse our store, we automatically receive your computer’s IP address, which helps us understand your browser and operating system.<br/>With your permission, we may send you emails about our store, new products, and updates.</p><h4><strong>SECTION 2 - CONSENT</strong></h4><p><strong>How do we obtain your consent?</strong><br/>When you provide personal information to complete a transaction, verify your payment, place an order, or arrange for delivery, we assume you consent to our collecting and using it for that specific purpose.<br/>If we need your information for secondary reasons (e.g., marketing), we will either ask for your explicit consent or provide an option to decline.</p><p><strong>How can you withdraw consent?</strong><br/>If you change your mind after opting in, you may withdraw your consent for us to contact you or use your information at any time by contacting us at <a href=\"mailto:info@imperialknots.com\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>info@imperialknots.com</strong></a>.</p><h4><strong>SECTION 3 - DISCLOSURE</strong></h4><p>We may disclose your personal information if required by law or if you violate our <strong>Terms of Service</strong>.</p><h4><strong>SECTION 4 - PAYMENT</strong></h4><p>If you use a direct payment gateway (e.g., credit card), your payment information is encrypted and processed in compliance with the <strong>Payment Card Industry Data Security Standard (PCI-DSS)</strong>. Your transaction data is stored only as long as necessary to complete the purchase, after which it is deleted.<br/>All payment gateways adhere to PCI-DSS standards, managed by the PCI Security Standards Council.</p><h4><strong>SECTION 5 - THIRD-PARTY SERVICES</strong></h4><p>Third-party providers we use will only collect, use, and disclose your information to the extent necessary to perform their services.<br/>However, some providers (e.g., payment gateways) have their own privacy policies. We recommend reviewing their policies to understand how they handle your information.<br/>If you proceed with a transaction involving a third-party provider, your information may become subject to the laws of the provider’s jurisdiction.<br/>Once you leave our store or are redirected to a third-party site, you are no longer governed by this Privacy Policy or our <strong>Terms of Service</strong>.</p><h4><strong>SECTION 6 - SECURITY</strong></h4><p>We follow industry best practices to protect your personal information from loss, misuse, or unauthorized access.<br/>Credit card information is encrypted using <strong>SSL (Secure Socket Layer)</strong> and stored with <strong>AES-256 encryption</strong>. While no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure, we adhere to PCI-DSS requirements and implement additional industry standards.</p><h4><strong>SECTION 7 - COOKIES</strong></h4><p>We use <strong>Google Analytics</strong> to collect information about site usage, such as pages visited and user behavior. Google Analytics uses cookies to track your IP address but does not collect personally identifiable information.<br/>You can disable Google Analytics cookies in your browser settings. For more details, review the <strong>Google Privacy Policy</strong>.</p><h4><strong>SECTION 8 - AGE OF CONSENT</strong></h4><p>By using this site, you confirm that you are the age of majority in your state or province of residence, or that you have given us consent to allow any minor dependents to use this site.</p><h4><strong>SECTION 9 - TRANSFER OF DATA ABROAD</strong></h4><p>If you visit this site from a country other than where our servers are located, your information may be transferred across international boundaries. By using this site, you consent to such transfers.</p><h4><strong>SECTION 10 - CHANGES TO THIS PRIVACY POLICY</strong></h4><p>We reserve the right to modify this policy at any time. Changes take effect immediately upon posting. If we make significant changes, we will notify you here.<br/>If our store is acquired or merged, your information may be transferred to the new owners to continue serving you.</p><h4><strong>SECTION 11 - COOKIES AND TRACKING</strong></h4><p>Cookies are small files stored on your device to enhance your browsing experience and collect anonymous data (e.g., pages visited, clickstream activity).<br/>We may use third-party advertising and analytics companies that employ cookies and web beacons. Any data collected by these third parties is anonymous.</p><h4><strong>SECTION 12 - GOOGLE PRIVACY POLICY</strong></h4><p>Certain features (e.g., Google Maps) are subject to the <strong>Google Privacy Policy</strong>.</p><h4><strong>SECTION 13 - YOUR CONSENT</strong></h4><p>By using this site, you agree to this Privacy Policy and our <strong>Terms of Service</strong>. We reserve the right to update this policy without prior notice. Changes will be posted on this page.</p><h4><strong>QUESTIONS AND CONTACT INFORMATION</strong></h4><p>For questions, to access, correct, or delete your personal information, or to file a complaint, contact our Privacy Compliance Officer at <a href=\"mailto:info@imperialknots.com\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>info@imperialknots.com</strong></a> or call <strong>+91-9555326200</strong>.</p>"
          }
